  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T13:57:41Z",
  "body": "Thanks for the heads-up, @nagahara-naoki! Please go ahead—I'll hold off on opening a PR so we don't duplicate work.\n\nOne small note from looking at `GenericKeyFn.keyOf()`: the quoted object-key branch (`if (entry.quoted) { key = `\"${key}\"`; }`) right below has the same unescaped-quote collision issue (e.g., `{'a\":1,\"b': 2}` vs `{\"a\": 1, \"b\": 2}`), so using `JSON.stringify(key)` there as well might be worth including in your PR.\n",
  "author_association": "NONE",
  "pin": null,
